{
    "title": "Collage Maker & Photo Editor",
    "description": "<b>FotoCollage Photo Editor</b> is a powerful and easy-to-use photo collage maker and photo editing app. Just select some images you love and easily arrange them in a perfect layout. Add a variety of backgrounds, text, stickers, and frames to create unique and awesome collages of your own.\r\n\r\n<b>FotoCollage will be your favorite Photo Editor.</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features:</b>\r\n\u25cf Combine photos with amazing layouts into beautiful collages\r\n\u25cf Remix up to 100 photos to create stunning layouts and collages\r\n\u25cf Change the photo layout, including rounded corners\r\n\u25cf Photo editing tools, allowing you to adjust sharpness and shadow\r\n\u25cf Create various kinds of backgrounds for your photos, such as blur\r\n\u25cf 37 unique photo effects for making a distinctive photo collage\r\n\u25cf Stickers, tags, emojis, texts, tens of photo borders and frames\r\n\u25cf Rotate, mirror, flip images, drag or swap them, pinch to zoom in or out\r\n\u25cf Add emojis and tags to make your photos more stylish\r\n\u25cf Transform your pics into art with perfect filters, effects, and photo editing tools\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>500+ layouts</b>\r\nThere are over 100 popular design templates in the fascinating pic collage tool. With these templates, you can mix up to 100 images, flexibly create collaged photos, and make a shaped collage, such as a heart or diamond. Show your style with your attractive collages!\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>Text</b>\r\nYou can enjoy a range of features, including font sizes, colors, gradients, outlines, shadows, spacing, and background edition in a free manner. Insert words anywhere in the collage to record your wonderful mood, share your experience, and make the collaged photos look even better.\r\n\r\n\u2b50<b> Emoji Stickers</b>\r\nChoose from over 500 funny stickers that can lend a festive touch to your photos. They are regularly updated to stay on trend. Besides, there are a variety of amazing makeup stickers, such as neon, muscle, wing, hair and more. Try adding emojis or makeup stickers to your collage, and see how it can enhance your creation.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>Background & Pattern</b>\r\nYou can choose a wide range of cute patterns as backgrounds, such as love, dot, xoxo, texture, and more. You can adjust their opacity, space, size, and angle. Subvert the traditional dull and boring styles with lively backgrounds that make your photos look more sophisticated. You can also add solid color, blur, and gradient color backgrounds to make your collage even more elegant.\r\n\r\n\u2b50<b> Filter with Advanced Looks</b>\r\nPhoto Filter can revolutionize your photos with just one tap. Lots of great filter effects can make people, pets, and food in your pics look perfect. You can also adjust the details of brightness, contrast, and warmth. Try out our filters and see how they can enhance your photos.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>Graffiti Brush</b>\r\nEnjoy FotoCollage with our cool customizable brushes. Doodle on pictures with many different brush types and get surprising effects, including enriched colors and adjustable strokes, such as patterns, solid lines, dotted lines, fluorescent brushes, and decorative brushes.\r\n\r\nWith <b>FotoCollage photo editor</b>, create your perfect photo collage with a wide variety of layouts, stickers, frames, and backgrounds, and become the focus of attention among friends on TikTok, WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook, and more. Try it out and have a wonderful time with FotoCollage!\r\n\r\nEnjoy making amazing photo collages and editing your photos with the best <b>FotoCollage</b>.\r\nIf you have any suggestions, feel free to contact us at connect.fotocollage@outlook.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>FotoCollage Photo Editor</b> is a powerful and easy-to-use photo collage maker and photo editing app. Just select some images you love and easily arrange them in a perfect layout. Add a variety of backgrounds, text, stickers, and frames to create unique and awesome collages of your own.<br><br><b>FotoCollage will be your favorite Photo Editor.</b><br><br><b>Key Features:</b><br>\u25cf Combine photos with amazing layouts into beautiful collages<br>\u25cf Remix up to 100 photos to create stunning layouts and collages<br>\u25cf Change the photo layout, including rounded corners<br>\u25cf Photo editing tools, allowing you to adjust sharpness and shadow<br>\u25cf Create various kinds of backgrounds for your photos, such as blur<br>\u25cf 37 unique photo effects for making a distinctive photo collage<br>\u25cf Stickers, tags, emojis, texts, tens of photo borders and frames<br>\u25cf Rotate, mirror, flip images, drag or swap them, pinch to zoom in or out<br>\u25cf Add emojis and tags to make your photos more stylish<br>\u25cf Transform your pics into art with perfect filters, effects, and photo editing tools<br><br>\u2b50 <b>500+ layouts</b><br>There are over 100 popular design templates in the fascinating pic collage tool. With these templates, you can mix up to 100 images, flexibly create collaged photos, and make a shaped collage, such as a heart or diamond. Show your style with your attractive collages!<br><br>\u2b50 <b>Text</b><br>You can enjoy a range of features, including font sizes, colors, gradients, outlines, shadows, spacing, and background edition in a free manner. Insert words anywhere in the collage to record your wonderful mood, share your experience, and make the collaged photos look even better.<br><br>\u2b50<b> Emoji Stickers</b><br>Choose from over 500 funny stickers that can lend a festive touch to your photos. They are regularly updated to stay on trend. Besides, there are a variety of amazing makeup stickers, such as neon, muscle, wing, hair and more. Try adding emojis or makeup stickers to your collage, and see how it can enhance your creation.<br><br>\u2b50 <b>Background &amp; Pattern</b><br>You can choose a wide range of cute patterns as backgrounds, such as love, dot, xoxo, texture, and more. You can adjust their opacity, space, size, and angle. Subvert the traditional dull and boring styles with lively backgrounds that make your photos look more sophisticated. You can also add solid color, blur, and gradient color backgrounds to make your collage even more elegant.<br><br>\u2b50<b> Filter with Advanced Looks</b><br>Photo Filter can revolutionize your photos with just one tap. Lots of great filter effects can make people, pets, and food in your pics look perfect. You can also adjust the details of brightness, contrast, and warmth. Try out our filters and see how they can enhance your photos.<br><br>\u2b50 <b>Graffiti Brush</b><br>Enjoy FotoCollage with our cool customizable brushes. Doodle on pictures with many different brush types and get surprising effects, including enriched colors and adjustable strokes, such as patterns, solid lines, dotted lines, fluorescent brushes, and decorative brushes.<br><br>With <b>FotoCollage photo editor</b>, create your perfect photo collage with a wide variety of layouts, stickers, frames, and backgrounds, and become the focus of attention among friends on TikTok, WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook, and more. Try it out and have a wonderful time with FotoCollage!<br><br>Enjoy making amazing photo collages and editing your photos with the best <b>FotoCollage</b>.<br>If you have any suggestions, feel free to contact us at connect.fotocollage@outlook.com",
